# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day26

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| distribute | 배포하다, 분배하다 | The company distributed the documents. |
| establish | 설립하다, 확립하다 | The company was established in 1995. |
| maintain | 유지하다 | The company maintains high standards. |
| expand | 확장하다 | The business expanded rapidly. |
| operate | 운영하다, 작동하다 | The machine operates automatically. |

